## Coverage

For requests covering a set of records, completion requires processing that set; one successful page is not completion.
Track target-record coverage and supporting-evidence coverage separately. Both must be complete for a fully grounded answer.
Before finishing, verify that every required record received the necessary analysis and that each conclusion is supported by the evidence retained.
One output per record does not establish this when evidence was incomplete. Exhaust WootQL, search, and relationship pagination.
If a user limit, exhausted budget, or blocker prevents completion, report partial coverage and why. Never silently substitute a sample.
